[I] High-level Python web framework

[T] Django is a high-level Python web framework designed to encourage
[T] rapid development and clean, pragmatic design. It provides built-in
[T] features for handling common web development tasks, including URL
[T] routing, template rendering, form handling, and database management
[T] via its Object-Relational Mapper (ORM). Besides promoting best
[T] practices like Model-View-Controller (MVC), it also includes admin
[T] interfaces, authentication system and security features out of the
[T] box.

[U] https://www.djangoproject.com/

[A] Django Authors
